{
  "info": {
    "name": "Decidiq Room System Link Suite",
    "description": "Newman tests for change live-room-conference-system-link, tasks 1, 2 and 5. The integriq synchronisation user reads a participant's roomSeat (REQ-RCSL-002); only the integriq-synchronisation group writes RoomSystemMessage, and a member neither writes nor reads one (REQ-RCSL-003); a member who is not staff of the meeting cannot apply a message again (REQ-RCSL-006). Two probe users: one in integriq-synchronisation, one in decidesk-members. Written, not yet run: it needs a live instance.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
